# Cursor & AI Agent Rules for Run Escape

1. MANDATORY PRE-READ: Always read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/AGENT_NOTES.md`, and `.jules/sentinel.md` before editing any files or resolving merges.
2. UPSTREAM-FRIENDLY MODULARIZATION:
   - Place custom characters, maps, enemies, secret codes, and content array overrides in `src/game/content/custom/` (`customCharacters.ts`, `customMaps.ts`, `customEnemies.ts`, `secretCodes.ts`, `customOverrides.ts`).
   - Place custom simulation, pickup recovery, and save helpers in `src/game/core/custom/` (`pickupRecovery.ts`, `customSimHooks.ts`, `customSave.ts`) and custom client/worker helpers in `src/game/client/custom/dogActors.ts` and `src/mapviewer/worker/customNpcIcon.ts`.
   - Place custom UI screens/modals/controls in standalone components under `src/game/ui/` (`LeaderboardScreen.tsx`, `CoopGameOverSection.tsx`, `CustomSettingsControls.tsx`) rather than inlining large blocks in `GameUi.tsx`.
   - Edit hand-authored runtime scripts (`multiplayer.js`, `multiplayer/mp-*.js`, `cooks-assistant.js`, `tile-coords.js`, `debug-mode.js`) in `src/custom/` (synced to `assets/` by `npm run build`).
   - Declare global `window.*` properties in `src/game/types/globals.d.ts`.
   - Keep root `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`, and `package-lock.json` untouched for upstream fast-forwards; record all custom changes in `docs/CHANGELOG.md`. Use LF (`\n`) line endings.
3. SOURCE-FIRST WORKFLOW & CACHE-BUSTING: Edit source in `src/` and compile via `npm run build` (`vite build && node scripts/sync_dist.cjs`). Never hand-edit minified bundles in `assets/index-*.js`.
4. MANDATORY HANDOFF LOG: Before finishing any task, commit, or PR, update `docs/CHANGELOG.md`, run `npm run build`, and prepend a new entry to `docs/AGENT_NOTES.md` under `## 3. Chronological Agent Handoff Log`.
5. VERIFICATION: Run `npx tsc --noEmit`, `npm test`, `python -m unittest test_serve.py`, and `node --check src/custom/multiplayer.js` prior to completion.
